OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,FAn "attention seeking" failed asylum
OL,7,Fseeker who went to a school armed with
OL,8,Fa hammer, a hatchet and a kitchen
OL,9,Fknife has been jailed for two years.
OL,11,FBoth Douk Deng, a South Sudanese
OL,12,Fnational, became "increasingly
OL,13,Ffrustrated" that immigration
OL,14,Fauthorities were not providing
OL,15,Fassistance in his bid to stay and work
OL,16,Fin the UK.
OL,26,@nD@DOUnD@VO]tD@ROUuD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/10
