FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785345525
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,FThe 21-year-old, who has applied for
OL,7,Fand been refused asylum three times,
OL,8,Fwanted to "create a scene for
OL,9,Fattention" to aid his cause,
OL,10,FManchester Minshull Street Crown Court
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FHe was arrested after workmen
OL,14,Fconfronted him on the premises of
OL,15,FEdgar Wood Academy in Heywood,
OL,16,FGreater, Manchester, on 6 August 2025.
OL,26,@pD@KOUqD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785345525
OL,3,CAsylum seeker armed with hammer at
OL,4,Cschool 'wanted attention'
OL,6,FA member of the public earlier raised
OL,7,Fthe alarm after he was observed
OL,8,F"behaving oddly" in the street nearby
OL,9,Fen route to the secondary school
OL,10,Fholding a petrol can with a hammer
OL,11,Ftied to his belt.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@PO]
